  m_text: '     ,    &     can appear on any reel in the main game.

    only appears
    during the bonus game.

    You have 3 chances to reselect at the start of the
    bonus game.

    Each new bonus symbol appearing on the reels will reset the
    reselect chances to 3. Each rockets has a corresponding bonus displayed on it.

    The
    bonus game ends when all 15 bonus symbols are collected, or the reselect spins
    are completed.

    At the end of the bonus game, all values of the bonus symbols
    will be added and paid as a bonus.

    One or more      have the chance to trigger
    a bonus game with a multiplier feature.

    One or more      have the chance
    to trigger a bonus game with the double reel feature.

    One or more      have
    the chance to trigger a bonus game with an extra reselect feature.

    Several
    or all features can be triggered in the same spin. During each bonus spin, any
    position containing coin will be held,

    and all other positions will spin'
