  m_text: 'The Double Reel feature adds a second independent reel.

    At the start
    of the bonus game, bonus symbols are copied from the bottom reel to the corresponding
    positions on the top reel.

    During the bonus game, bonus symbols randomly
    appear on both reels.

    Each reel has its own reselect spins'
