  m_text: "During the bonus game, MINI, MINOR, MAJOR, and GRAND symbols will randomly
    appear and award the corresponding accumulated jackpot. \n\nCollecting all 15
    different types of bonus symbols during the bonus game will award the Grand Jackpot.\n\nIn
    the Double Reel Feature Bonus Game, collecting all 15 of any type of bonus symbols
    will award two jackpots.\n\nAfter each Jackpot is paid, the Jackpot meter amount
    will reset before any other Jackpot is paid."
